      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Panel Detail Konfigurasi ISO8583",
      "id": "detail-panel",
      "intro": "Panel detail menampilkan informasi lengkap dari konfigurasi ISO8583 yang dipilih. Panel ini memiliki dua tab utama: General dan History, ditampilkan dalam format pills-style yang modern.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Tab General — Config Identity & Metadata",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Panel detail muncul ketika pengguna memilih (klik) salah satu konfigurasi dari daftar.\n• **Summary Sidebar** (kiri, 260px) menampilkan:\n  - **Config Identity** — ID konfigurasi dengan ikon gradient indigo.\n  - **System Identifier** — Nomor ID unik konfigurasi.\n  - Tombol **View Details** — Membuka drawer detail lengkap (1400px) dengan 7 sub-tab.\n  - Tombol **Edit Config** dan **Delete Config** (jika memiliki permission).\n• **Config Metadata** (kanan) menampilkan grid informasi:\n  - Config ID, Internal Name, Scheme Type\n  - Header Length, TPDU Header, Bitmap Encoding\n  - Secondary Bitmap (True/False), Timeout Seconds\n• Setiap field metadata ditampilkan dengan ikon berwarna dan animasi fade-in.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(99,102,241,.1);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:100px;padding:10px;background:#f8fafc;border-right:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#06b6d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#fff;font-weight:800;\">#</span></div><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Config ID</span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#1e1b4b;\">#42</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;\">System Identifier</div><button style=\"margin-top:10px;width:100%;padding:4px;border-radius:5px;background:#6366f1;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:3px;\">View Details</button></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:6px;\">Config Metadata</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(99,102,241,.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:6px;color:#6366f1;\">●</span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Name</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ISO_VISA</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(59,130,246,.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:6px;color:#3b82f6;\">●</span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Scheme</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ISO8583</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(249,115,22,.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:6px;color:#f97316;\">●</span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Header</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">12</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(6,182,212,.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:6px;color:#06b6d4;\">●</span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;\">Bitmap</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">BINARY</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab History — Riwayat Perubahan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **History** menampilkan timeline perubahan konfigurasi.\n• Setiap entri riwayat mencakup:\n  - **Initiator** — Nama pengguna yang melakukan perubahan.\n  - **Timestamp** — Waktu perubahan dilakukan.\n  - **Message** — Deskripsi aksi yang dilakukan.\n  - **Previous Value** (accordion merah) — Nilai sebelum perubahan.\n  - **New Value** (accordion biru) — Nilai setelah perubahan.\n• Tombol **Full Screen** tersedia untuk melihat riwayat dalam mode layar penuh.\n• Timeline menggunakan bullet indicator yang menunjukkan tipe operasi (create/update/delete).",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(99,102,241,.1);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#fff;width:260px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;gap:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;color:#6366f1;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">General</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;background:#6366f1;color:#fff;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;\">History</span></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;border:2px solid #bbf7d0;\"></div><div style=\"width:2px;flex:1;background:#e2e8f0;\"></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Admin User</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;\">2025-01-15 14:30:00</div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#475569;margin-top:3px;\">Updated bitmap encoding</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.05);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:7px;color:#dc2626;\">Previous: ASCII</div><div style=\"margin-top:2px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(59,130,246,.05);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,.1);font-size:7px;color:#2563eb;\">New: BINARY</div></div></div></div></div>"
